    "description": "Introducing RideRTC, the all-in-one transit app for Southern Nevada residents and visitors. RideRTC is the easy way to buy transit passes, plan your trip, and access customer service--right from your phone! RideRTC is a complete transit tool. The app is easy to setup and use--you'll never buy a paper ticket again.",
